{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41174","headline":"夜宿荒村 · 孔德绍","name":"夜宿荒村","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"绵绵夕漏深，客恨转伤心。\n抚弦无人听，对酒时独斟。\n故乡万里绝，穷愁百虑侵。\n秋草思边马，遶枝惊夜禽。\n风度谷余响，月斜山半阴。\n劳歌欲叙意，终是白头吟。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孔德绍","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_41174.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41174","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}